{"4841370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "WARPED", "steam_appid": 4841370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4858290], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARPED</strong> is a polished arcade space shooter built around fast movement, satisfying combat, and classic sci-fi action. Pilot your ship through dangerous sectors of the solar system, survive waves of hostile UFOs, dodge asteroid fields, collect power-ups, and push deeper into space to find the source of <i>the signal</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/65c1d94b4e8701ee6347959b1199d03f.poster.avif?t=1784308416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/65c1d94b4e8701ee6347959b1199d03f.webm?t=1784308416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/65c1d94b4e8701ee6347959b1199d03f.mp4?t=1784308416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple ship classes, each with its own strengths, weaknesses, and playstyle. Whether you prefer balanced firepower, heavy defense, fast movement, or hard-hitting shots, every ship changes how you survive the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/ae2f5ff5c12d23063b85791b1028c23f.poster.avif?t=1784308416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/ae2f5ff5c12d23063b85791b1028c23f.webm?t=1784308416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/ae2f5ff5c12d23063b85791b1028c23f.mp4?t=1784308416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a campaign that takes you from Earth’s orbit to the outer edges of the solar system and far beyond, or jump straight into Endless Arcade mode for quick, high-score chasing action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/5a0f9331104158fb2fb847fe8d7d753d.poster.avif?t=1784308416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/5a0f9331104158fb2fb847fe8d7d753d.webm?t=1784308416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/5a0f9331104158fb2fb847fe8d7d753d.mp4?t=1784308416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast twin-stick space combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign and Endless Arcade modes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable ship classes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local co-op support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-ups, upgrades, and chaotic enemy waves</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asteroids, UFOs, bosses, and space hazards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro arcade style with vibrant sci-fi visuals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller-friendly gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local high scores and replayable score-chasing action</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with the spirit of classic arcade shooters, <strong>WARPED</strong> is easy to pick up, exciting to master, and packed with colorful space action. The signal is calling, Pilot. Will you answer?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WARPED</strong> is a polished arcade space shooter built around fast movement, satisfying combat, and classic sci-fi action. Pilot your ship through dangerous sectors of the solar system, survive waves of hostile UFOs, dodge asteroid fields, collect power-ups, and push deeper into space to find the source of <i>the signal</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/65c1d94b4e8701ee6347959b1199d03f.poster.avif?t=1784308416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/65c1d94b4e8701ee6347959b1199d03f.webm?t=1784308416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/65c1d94b4e8701ee6347959b1199d03f.mp4?t=1784308416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from multiple ship classes, each with its own strengths, weaknesses, and playstyle. Whether you prefer balanced firepower, heavy defense, fast movement, or hard-hitting shots, every ship changes how you survive the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/ae2f5ff5c12d23063b85791b1028c23f.poster.avif?t=1784308416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/ae2f5ff5c12d23063b85791b1028c23f.webm?t=1784308416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/ae2f5ff5c12d23063b85791b1028c23f.mp4?t=1784308416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a campaign that takes you from Earth’s orbit to the outer edges of the solar system and far beyond, or jump straight into Endless Arcade mode for quick, high-score chasing action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/5a0f9331104158fb2fb847fe8d7d753d.poster.avif?t=1784308416\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/5a0f9331104158fb2fb847fe8d7d753d.webm?t=1784308416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4841370/extras/5a0f9331104158fb2fb847fe8d7d753d.mp4?t=1784308416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast twin-stick space combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign and Endless Arcade modes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple playable ship classes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local co-op support</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-ups, upgrades, and chaotic enemy waves</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asteroids, UFOs, bosses, and space hazards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro arcade style with vibrant sci-fi visuals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller-friendly gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local high scores and replayable score-chasing action</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_parag